et lost and sometimes stubborn as they learn how to walk.\nBut you'll be able to save all the slippers.\n\nA new concept of shooting puzzle game.\nIt is a shooting puzzle game that makes a way for AI characters wandering in a maze to move easily and safely.\n\n100 stages with various solutions.\nVarious maze shapes, slippers, objects, and daemons are combined, so each stage can be played differently each time.", "short_description": "Save the slippers that are hanging in the maze of nightmares!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(2)1440_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "843670026323221", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974680_843670029656554_4170918606599011011_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=irZv49wNc8QQ7kNvwEvX6FP&_nc_oc=AdnASznh6UVGV6_-CZ_ztzKWyx7MhZ3klrDZ8vtzXm0G8BufhtogWXyEGeWS5Zx2S5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftCqtjxXxQVtxlumVHkocGv7j1WukAEuM8qlV6ehX4F2w&oe=69A5931F"}, {"file_name": "\uba54\uc778(\uc2dc\uc5482)2560_1440(211029) \ud55c\uae00.png", "id": "627571058261409", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036641_627571061594742_7128199620299863828_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nYq5IAEDzQIQ7kNvwFlllKt&_nc_oc=AdmrZVpNFdjUh6GiO3ywX2YvihGKXZUkQqodjb43cBy0OMT_Dzo9sfGdaD8hoyHNvNg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs7-iy45Qqf7-W64OOpk64hcsQe2f-X54toK1erEHb46Q&oe=69A58F07"}, {"file_name": "app_logo.png", "id": "583935226146634", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223477_583935232813300_935540870816570877_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SqKyqwHPEKAQ7kNvwEu3xUl&_nc_oc=Admm8_8P-k5Y_YKMIvmMNOxPyR9KUI0a2Nx9zMTq6tJgSglnVTcl4KezbvhYQzonJuE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvjmsgpbGfcdGzbLMoiS_0JVBZQqgXG7ZD8HKcTHa2_hw&oe=69A59357"}, {"file_name": "